# __PLUGIN_NAME__

A Valuz App Plugin (`__PLUGIN_ID__`).

## Develop

```bash
valuz-plugin dev        # build in watch mode + link into the running Valuz
valuz-plugin test       # run test/**/*.test.tsx
valuz-plugin validate   # check manifest, files and the built bundle
valuz-plugin pack       # dist/__PLUGIN_ID__-<version>.zip + sha256
```

`valuz-plugin` comes with `@valuz/plugin-sdk` (if it is not on PATH:
`node __SDK_BIN__`). The same commands are available as `npm run build|dev|test|validate|pack`.

## Install

- Development: `valuz plugin app dev .` (or `valuz-plugin dev`) links this
  directory; every rebuild reloads the plugin in Valuz.
- Package: `valuz-plugin pack`, then `valuz plugin app install dist/<zip>` or
  Settings → Plugins → App Plugins → Install.

See `AGENTS.md` for the plugin rules, the public slots and the `ctx.valuz` API.
